    "Refine EMPF dense DualNorm profile from newton_schulz_v1 to size-gated hybrid optimizer_dense_profile = 'newton_schulz_hybrid_v1' (empf-v7 over empf-v6): mirror DualNorm's per-offset convolution channel split by retaining exact polar_factor SVD with hard rank cutoff on small/medium dense matrices (min_dim < 64 or max_dim <= 128) while routing large dense matrices (min_dim >= 64 and max_dim > 128) through DualNorm's guarded 32-iteration cubic Newton-Schulz regularized polar solver (_newton_schulz_polar + CUDA _PolarGraphCache) with 1e-3 residual guards and exact polar_factor fallback."
