  "id": "empf-v7",
  "mechanism_class": "structural",
  "mechanism_rationale": "Across empf-v5 and empf-v6, exact polar_factor SVD (empf-v5) passed all 12/12 non-word counted Tier 1 gates including model_ae_gan_multimodal (mse 0.0080) and precision_gaussian_fp32 (cdf_ks 0.0295) while hitting the 900s wall-time cap on five_word_joint_smoke; conversely, applying 32-iteration Newton-Schulz to all 2D matrices (empf-v6) passed five_word_joint_smoke in 549.7s (modes=5, quality_fraction=1.0, mass_tv=0.0189) but drifted on ill-conditioned small MLP layers (hidden <= 64) due to omitting exact SVD's rank cutoff. Size-gating Newton-Schulz to min_dim >= 64 and max_dim > 128 ('newton_schulz_hybrid_v1') preserves exact polar_factor updates on all hidden <= 128 tasks while replacing 78.8% of cuSOLVER SVD latency on wide/deep discrete-simplex joint MLPs.",
